  message: "Fixed in PR #2183, the four filed places. (1) catalog / catalogue: no name was renamed; the other spelling is accepted as an alias (catalogue, init-catalogues, catalogue-inventory, trust-catalogs, --in-repo-catalogs). Which spelling the help leads with is left to the owner. (2) trust-backend takes rust-analyzer as --backend spells it, and rust_analyzer still. (3) --input: all ten commands resolve it through _get_or_run_analysis, so the real behaviour is 'the cached survey, or a fresh analysis'; the eleven optional --input options take their help from one constant (INPUT_HELP). (4) The default sketch budget is DEFAULT_SKETCH_TOKENS = 8000, quoted by the -t help; 'auto token budget' is gone. Also 'behavior map' (14 lines) and 'run writes' now say survey. BEHAVIOUR: 'hypergumbo catalogue', 'hypergumbo trust-catalogs --show' and 'hypergumbo trust-backend rust-analyzer --show' run the same commands as the other spellings. The check asked for: test_cli_help_one_name_per_thing.py (a noun in two spellings among subcommands, long options and choices must be accepted both ways in the same place; no two typed names differ only by separator). RESIDUAL filed: WI-dilis-kujov-giput-hinor-sivos-bolin-lomov-rinul (-x with three meanings, --json beside --format json, --out and --output on slice, the backend printed with an underscore)."  # 1bb9
